<h1>Privacy</h1>

<p class="lede">This site does not ask who you are, does not use accounts and does not set cookies.</p>

<h2 id="tools">What you enter in the calculators</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Everything you enter is worked out in your own browser.</li>
  <li>Apart from the page address described below, the site does not send it to us or to anyone else, and does not save it.</li>
  <li>The rule comparison and the history explorer put their settings in the page address when you show a result, so that a copied link shows the same result. The settings are what you chose and typed in the form, including any amount you entered, so do not share the link if an amount is your own. Like any page address, it is sent to the web host when the page loads, and your browser keeps it in its history.</li>
  <li>The budget explorer and the triple lock calculator put nothing in the page address, and the site keeps nothing you enter in them. If your browser brings the budget explorer back when you return to it, the page clears your amounts and the result. A browser can still offer to fill in a form from its own memory. That is a browser setting, not this site.</li>
  <li>The budget explorer has a button, "Clear everything I entered", that clears it at once.</li>
</ul>
<p>If you download or copy a table from the history explorer, the file holds the rates shown and any calculation you chose to add. It holds nothing about you.</p>

<h2 id="analytics">Analytics</h2>
<p>This preview has no analytics and loads nothing from any other website. When the site is published it will use Cloudflare Web Analytics. Before that happens, this page will say what is collected. Amounts entered in a calculator will never be included.</p>

<h2 id="hosting">The company that hosts the site</h2>
<p>Any web host keeps a technical record of requests, such as the address of the page asked for and the time. This site is hosted by Netlify. Read the <a href="https://www.netlify.com/privacy/">Netlify privacy notice</a>.</p>

<h2 id="links">Links to other websites</h2>
<p>This site links to GOV.UK, to the publishers of its sources and to its two sister sites. Each has its own privacy notice.</p>
